<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>Training loss vs. steps</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A6.F6.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.06048v1/figures/val_loss_r1.png" id="A6.F6.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:127/99;" width="127" height="99" alt="Refer to caption">
